problems.q:
Inputs a, b, c; g1 = AND(b, c); g2 = AND(a, g1); g3 = OR(c, g2); g4 = NAND(c, g3); g5 = NAND(a, g4); primary output g5. Targeting c stuck-at-1, the D-algorithm has reached the assignment a = 0, b = X, c = 0 and implied every value it can. What is the D-frontier?

A) {g1, g4}

B) {g1}

C) {g3}

D) {g1, g3}

Inputs a, b, c; g1 = NOR(a, c); g2 = NAND(c, g1); g3 = NOR(b, c); g4 = OR(g1, g3); g5 = OR(g2, g4); g6 = OR(g2, g5); primary output g6. Targeting c stuck-at-0, the D-algorithm has reached the assignment a = X, b = X, c = 1 and implied every value it can. What is the D-frontier?

A) {g1, g2, g3, g5}

B) {g1, g2, g3}

C) {g1, g2, g3, g4}

D) {g4}

Inputs a, b, c, d; g1 = NOR(a, d); g2 = NAND(c, g1); g3 = OR(g1, g2); g4 = NAND(g2, g3); g5 = NOR(b, g4); g6 = NAND(g1, g5); g7 = NOR(g1, g4); primary outputs g6 and g7. Targeting b stuck-at-0, the D-algorithm has reached the assignment a = 0, b = 1, c = X, d = 0 and implied every value it can. What is the D-frontier?

A) {g2}

B) {g5}

C) {g2, g5}

D) {g4, g5}

Inputs a, b, c; g1 = NAND(a, c); g2 = AND(b, g1); g3 = AND(g1, g2); g4 = NAND(c, g1); g5 = OR(g3, g4); primary output g5. The D-algorithm has assigned a = 1, c = 0, g1 = 1, g3 = 1; every other line is X, and values have been implied forward from the assigned lines. Which gates form the J-frontier?

A) {g3}

B) {g2, g3}

C) {g1, g3}

D) {g1}

Inputs a, b, c, d; g1 = AND(b, c); g2 = NOR(b, g1); g3 = NAND(d, g1); g4 = OR(a, g3); primary outputs g2 and g4. The D-algorithm has assigned a = 0, g2 = 1, g4 = 1; every other line is X, and values have been implied forward from the assigned lines. Which gates form the J-frontier?

A) {g2, g4}

B) {g2, g3, g4}

C) {g1, g2, g4}

D) {g1}

Inputs a, b, c, d; g1 = AND(b, d); g2 = NOR(a, g1); g3 = NOR(c, g2); g4 = NOR(g1, g3); g5 = NOR(c, g4); g6 = NOR(g4, g5); primary output g6. The D-algorithm has assigned c = 1, g5 = 0, g6 = 0; every other line is X, and values have been implied forward from the assigned lines. Which gates form the J-frontier?

A) {g2, g6}

B) {g1}

C) {g6}

D) {g1, g6}
